t":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-p056"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-p088-wudi-p0038","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-p088"]},{"id":"cuimao-m2-role-b18f6203007ed9be676b","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["cuimao-q-0f658b8a93e86a987868","cuimao-q2-393b6ab4c03dbae03d80"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"cuimao-q-0f658b8a93e86a987868","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-ad54538018c47a5ca636","layer":"original","quote":"初，太祖性忌，有所不堪者；鲁国孔融，﹝五﹞南阳许攸、﹝六﹞娄圭，皆以恃旧不虔见诛","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-2021b79747522e6de9b9","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-dbb7456b60d229024eec","layer":"pei","quote":"官渡之役，谏绍勿与太祖相攻","attribution":"裴注·《魏略》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":102,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-63f8ce8fdc7003927249","start":42,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-3e1d451631fc6957b4cd","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-dbb7456b60d229024eec","layer":"pei","quote":"攸自恃勋劳，时与太祖相戏；每在席，不自限齐；至呼太祖小字，曰：‘某甲，卿不得我，不得冀州也！’太祖笑曰：‘汝言是也。’然内嫌之","attribution":"裴注·《魏略》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":102,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-63f8ce8fdc7003927249","start":104,"end":167,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-3fe77fdbb1214e3aa1c5","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-dbb7456b60d229024eec","layer":"pei","quote":"其后从行出邺东门，顾谓左右曰：‘此家非得我，则不得出入此门也。’人有白者，遂见收之","attribution":"裴注·《魏略》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":102,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-63f8ce8fdc7003927249","start":168,"end":209,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-5957a634debf5d04a28d","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-dbb7456b60d229024eec","layer":"pei","quote":"绍破走，及后得冀州，攸有功焉","attribution":"裴注·《魏略》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":102,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-63f8ce8fdc7003927249","start":89,"end":103,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-76015e2c0792bc5ababe","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-dbb7456b60d229024eec","layer":"pei","quote":"绍自以强盛，必欲极其兵势；攸知不可为谋，乃亡诣太祖","attribution":"裴注·《魏略》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":102,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-63f8ce8fdc7003927249","start":63,"end":88,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q2-393b6ab4c03dbae03d80","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-ad54538018c47a5ca636","layer":"original","quote":"初，太祖性忌，有所不堪者；鲁国孔融，﹝五﹞南阳许攸、﹝六﹞娄圭，皆以恃旧不虔见诛〖18〗。﹝七﹞而琰，最为世所痛惜，至今冤之。﹝八﹞","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":66,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o044c-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-9378127fbfcbf250d81d","layer":"original","quote":"众数十万。以审配、逢纪统军事〖5〗；田丰、荀谌、许攸为谋主〖6〗；颜良、文丑为将率；简精卒十万〖7〗，骑万匹，将攻许。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":278,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":78,"end":137,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-e-p088a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-778698dc9ff28dc9114b","layer":"pei","quote":"初，绍去董卓，出奔，与许攸及纪俱诣冀州。绍以纪聪达有计策，甚亲信之，与共举事。","attribution":"《英雄记》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":362,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4eca1babb8466a404a95","start":16,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o044","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-9378127fbfcbf250d81d","layer":"original","quote":"顷之，击破瓒于易京〖4〗，并其众。﹝三﹞出长子谭为青州，沮授谏绍：“必为祸始。”绍不听，曰：“孤欲令诸儿各据一州也。”﹝四﹞又以中子熙为幽州，甥高幹为并州，众数十万。以审配、逢纪统军事〖5〗；田丰、荀谌、许攸为谋主〖6〗；颜良、文丑为将率；简精卒十万〖7〗，骑万匹，将攻许。﹝五﹞","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":278,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":140,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p056","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-820911e33630e6596e34","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《英雄记》曰：“绍生而父死，二公爱之。幼使为郎，弱冠除濮阳长，有清名。遭母丧；服竟，又追行父服：凡在冢庐六年。礼毕，隐居洛阳，不妄通宾客；非海内知名，不得相见。又好游侠，与张孟卓、何伯求、吴子卿、许子远、伍德瑜等，皆为奔走之友。不应辟命。中常侍赵忠谓诸黄门曰：‘袁本初坐作声价，不应呼召而养死士；不知此儿欲何所为乎！’绍叔父隗闻之，责数绍曰：‘汝且破我家！’绍于是乃起，应大将军之命。”","attribution":"《英雄记》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":215,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bf0d3b8b250635b85059","start":0,"end":196,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p076-judgment","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-db94f2025a3cc6337b58","layer":"pei","quote":"孙盛评曰：“按魏武谓崔琰曰‘昨案贵州户籍，可得三十万众’。由此推之，但冀州胜兵已如此；况兼幽、并及青州乎？绍之大举，必悉师而起：十万近之矣。","attribution":"孙盛评","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":294,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f9b297d2a3b3d9e09127","start":21,"end":91,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p088","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-778698dc9ff28dc9114b","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《英雄记》曰：“纪字元图。初，绍去董卓，出奔，与许攸及纪俱诣冀州。绍以纪聪达有计策，甚亲信之，与共举事。后审配任用，与纪不睦。或有谗配于绍，绍问纪，纪称‘配天性烈直，古人之节，不宜疑之’。绍曰：‘君不恶之邪？’纪答曰：‘先日所争者，私情；今所陈者，国事。’绍善之，卒不废配。配由是更与纪为亲善。”","attribution":"《英雄记》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":362,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4eca1babb8466a404a95","start":0,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o005a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-0c67d32d2029b25115d6","layer":"original","quote":"顷之，冀州刺史王芬、南阳许攸、沛国周旌等连结豪杰〖10〗，谋废灵帝〖11〗，立合肥侯〖12〗，以告太祖。太祖拒之，芬等遂败。﹝三﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o065a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-58c959449a0f1f33e31e","layer":"original","quote":"是时，袁绍既并公孙瓒〖13〗，兼四州之地〖14〗，众十余万，将进军攻许。诸将以为不可敌。公曰：“吾知绍之为人：志大而智小；色厉而胆薄〖15〗；忌克而少威〖16〗；兵多而分画不明〖17〗；将骄而政令不一。土地虽广，粮食虽丰，适足以为吾奉也〖18〗！”","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":362,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":124,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o080a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-f14e576d21da5d0fb49a","layer":"original","quote":"绍谋臣许攸贪财，绍不能足〖5〗；来奔，因说公击琼等。左右疑之，荀攸、贾诩劝公。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":436,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":34,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p016a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-27342ea0cc40a8b4e589","layer":"pei","quote":"于是陈蕃子逸与术士平原襄楷，会于芬坐，楷曰：‘天文不利宦者，黄门、常侍（贵）〔真〕族灭矣。’逸喜。芬曰：‘若然者，芬愿驱除。’于是与攸等结谋。","attribution":"《九州春秋》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":57,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4ada009fc136a7fb3275","start":15,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p058a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-bbbe4336f02b0989fc5d","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞习凿齿《汉晋春秋》曰：“许攸说绍曰：‘公无与操相攻也！急分诸军持之，而径从他道迎天子，则事立济矣。’绍不从，曰：‘吾要当先围取之！’攸怒。”","attribution":"习凿齿《汉晋春秋》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":432,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5b82cd36398c174f0a7c","start":0,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p060a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-abd4b2bac1fa03787470","layer":"pei","quote":"公闻攸来，跣出迎之，抚掌笑曰：‘子卿远来，吾事济矣！’既入坐，谓公曰：‘袁氏军盛，何以待之？今有几粮乎？’公曰：‘尚可支一岁。’攸自：‘无是，更言之！’又曰：‘可支半岁。’攸曰：‘足下不欲破袁氏邪？何言之不实也！’公曰：‘向言戏之耳！其实可一月，为之奈何？’攸曰：‘公孤军独守，外无救援而粮谷已尽，此危急之日也。今袁氏辎重有万余乘，在故市、乌巢，屯军无严备。今以轻兵袭之，不意而至，燔其积聚。不过三日，袁氏自败也。’","attribution":"《曹瞒传》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":452,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-28c22dc25bf80c877b3b","start":11,"end":219,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p060b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-abd4b2bac1fa03787470","layer":"pei","quote":"公大喜，乃举精锐步骑；皆用袁军旗帜，衔枚缚马口；夜从间道出，人抱束薪。所历道，有问者，（语）〔绐〕之曰：‘袁公恐曹操抄略后军，遣兵以益备。’闻者信以为然，皆自若。既至，围屯，大放火，营中惊乱，大破之。尽燔其粮谷宝货；斩督将眭元进、骑督韩莒子、吕威璜、赵叡等首；割得将军淳于仲简鼻，未死。杀士卒千余人，皆取鼻，牛马割唇舌，以示绍军。将士皆怛惧。时有夜得仲简，将以诣麾下。公谓曰：‘何为如是？’仲简曰：‘胜负自天，何用为问乎！’公意欲不杀。许攸曰：‘明旦鉴于镜，此益不忘人。’乃杀之。","attribution":"《曹瞒传》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":452,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-28c22dc25bf80c877b3b","start":219,"end":459,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-3bbf4ea44af9d93d0048","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-3bbf4ea44af9d93d0048","layer":"modern","quote":"〖10〗刺史：官名。本来是皇帝派出的使者，巡察一州之内官员和豪强的不法行为。东汉后期成为一州的行政长官。许攸：字子远，南阳郡（治所在今河南南阳市）人。曾任袁绍谋士，官渡之战又投奔曹操，不久被杀。传见本书卷十二《崔琰传》裴注引《魏略》。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2499880477bd00967992","start":0,"end":117,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-51bced16741add42ff70","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-51bced16741add42ff70","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：建安四年（公元 199）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":369,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-20628d34a709162c77f0","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-9900125064e5d85f08ad","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-9900125064e5d85f08ad","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗五年：建安五年（公元 200）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":403,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-744e4aee7f5ff14cca85","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o005","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-0c67d32d2029b25115d6","layer":"original","quote":"顷之，冀州刺史王芬、南阳许攸、沛国周旌等连结豪杰〖10〗，谋废灵帝〖11〗，立合肥侯〖12〗，以告太祖。太祖拒之，芬等遂败。﹝三﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o061","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-502d4e8c0ed143eaa30d","layer":"original","quote":"四年春二月〖1〗，公还至昌邑〖2〗。张杨将杨丑杀杨〖3〗。眭固又杀丑，以其众属袁绍，屯射犬〖4〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":358,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o071","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c9f735ddad48a8f5c2b6","layer":"original","quote":"五年春正月〖1〗，董承等谋泄，皆伏诛。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":400,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o080","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-f14e576d21da5d0fb49a","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，绍遣车运谷；使淳于琼等五人，将兵万余人送之，宿绍营北四十里。绍谋臣许攸贪财，绍不能足〖5〗；来奔，因说公击琼等。左右疑之，荀攸、贾诩劝公。公乃留曹洪守，自将步骑五千人，夜往。会明至〖6〗，琼等望见公兵少，出阵门外。公急击之，琼退保营，遂攻之。绍遣骑救琼，左右或言：“贼骑稍近，请分兵拒之！”公怒曰：“贼在背后，乃白！”士卒皆殊死战，大破琼等，皆斩之。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":436,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":182,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p016","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-27342ea0cc40a8b4e589","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞司马彪《九州春秋》曰：“于是陈蕃子逸与术士平原襄楷，会于芬坐，楷曰：‘天文不利宦者，黄门、常侍（贵）〔真〕族灭矣。’逸喜。芬曰：‘若然者，芬愿驱除。’于是与攸等结谋。灵帝欲北巡河间旧宅，芬等谋因此作难，上书言黑山贼攻劫郡县，求得起兵。会北方有赤气，东西竟天。太史上言‘当有阴谋，不宜北行’，帝乃止。敕芬罢兵，俄而征之；芬惧，自杀。”","attribution":"《九州春秋》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":57,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4ada009fc136a7fb3275","start":0,"end":169,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p058","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-bbbe4336f02b0989fc5d","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞习凿齿《汉晋春秋》曰：“许攸说绍曰：‘公无与操相攻也！急分诸军持之，而径从他道迎天子，则事立济矣。’绍不从，曰：‘吾要当先围取之！’攸怒。”","attribution":"习凿齿《汉晋春秋》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":432,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5b82cd36398c174f0a7c","start":0,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p060","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-abd4b2bac1fa03787470","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《曹瞒传》曰：“公闻攸来，跣出迎之，抚掌笑曰：‘子卿远来，吾事济矣！’既入坐，谓公曰：‘袁氏军盛，何以待之？今有几粮乎？’公曰：‘尚可支一岁。’攸自：‘无是，更言之！’又曰：‘可支半岁。’攸曰：‘足下不欲破袁氏邪？何言之不实也！’公曰：‘向言戏之耳！其实可一月，为之奈何？’攸曰：‘公孤军独守，外无救援而粮谷已尽，此危急之日也。今袁氏辎重有万余乘，在故市、乌巢，屯军无严备。今以轻兵袭之，不意而至，燔其积聚。不过三日，袁氏自败也。’公大喜，乃举精锐步骑；皆用袁军旗帜，衔枚缚马口；夜从间道出，人抱束薪。所历道，有问者，（语）〔绐〕之曰：‘袁公恐曹操抄略后军，遣兵以益备。’闻者信以为然，皆自若。既至，围屯，大放火，营中惊乱，大破之。尽燔其粮谷宝货；斩督将眭元进、骑督韩莒子、吕威璜、赵叡等首；割得将军淳于仲简鼻，未死。杀士卒千余人，皆取鼻，牛马割唇舌，以示绍军。将士皆怛惧。时有夜得仲简，将以诣麾下。公谓曰：‘何为如是？’仲简曰：‘胜负自天，何用为问乎！’公意欲不杀。许攸曰：‘明旦鉴于镜，此益不忘人。’乃杀之。”","attribution":"《曹瞒传》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":452,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-28c22dc25bf80c877b3b","start":0,"end":460,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-e-o021b-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-b530db2d928e9990c4ea","layer":"original","quote":"审配以许攸家不法，收其妻子，攸怒叛绍；颜良、文丑，临阵授首；田丰，以谏见诛：皆如彧所策。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":111,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":125,"end":169,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-e-o044a-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-00e277486b15d03f6566","layer":"original","quote":"会许攸来降，言：“绍遣淳于琼等将万余兵迎运粮，将骄卒惰，可邀击也。”众皆疑，唯攸与贾诩劝太祖。太祖乃留攸及曹洪守，太祖自将攻破之，尽斩琼等。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":222,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-b-3c961618b484f81c3582","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-3c961618b484f81c3582","layer":"modern","quote":"〖3〗五年：建安五年（公元 200）。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":115,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3bbb3ef01ba77a895b2f","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-o018","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-c84a0f39812ff83ca230","layer":"original","quote":"三年〖1〗，太祖既破张绣，东擒吕布，定徐州；遂与袁绍相拒。孔融谓彧曰：“绍，地广兵强；田丰、许攸，智计之士也，为之谋；审配、逢纪，尽忠之臣也，任其事；颜良、文丑，勇冠三军，统其兵：殆难克乎？”","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":96,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-o019","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-e41cc51e4535ef52879b","layer":"original","quote":"彧曰：“绍兵虽多，而法不整；田丰刚而犯上，许攸贪而不治；审配专而无谋，逢纪果而自用〖2〗，此二人留知后事，若攸家犯其法，必不能纵也，不纵，攸必为变；颜良、文丑，一夫之勇耳！可一战而擒也。”","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":109,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":94,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-o020","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-ae8147f907358950d8ac","layer":"original","quote":"五年〖3〗，与绍连战。太祖保官渡，绍围之；太祖军粮方尽，书与彧，议欲还许，以引绍〖4〗。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-o021","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-b530db2d928e9990c4ea","layer":"original","quote":"彧曰：“今军食虽少，未若楚、汉在荥阳、成皋间也〖5〗。是时刘、项，莫肯先退；先退者，势屈也。公以十分居一之众，画地而守之，扼其喉而不得进，已半年矣。情见势竭，必将有变；此用奇之时，不可失也！”太祖乃住，遂以奇兵袭绍别屯〖6〗，斩其将淳于琼等，绍退走；审配以许攸家不法，收其妻子，攸怒叛绍；颜良、文丑，临阵授首；田丰，以谏见诛：皆如彧所策。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":111,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":169,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-o044","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-00e277486b15d03f6566","layer":"original","quote":"会许攸来降，言：“绍遣淳于琼等将万余兵迎运粮，将骄卒惰，可邀击也。”众皆疑，唯攸与贾诩劝太祖。太祖乃留攸及曹洪守，太祖自将攻破之，尽斩琼等。绍将张郃、高览，烧攻橹降，绍遂弃军走。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":222,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":89,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-p036","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-31f1502dacdc020e14c0","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞张璠《汉纪》曰：“颙，字伯求。少与郭泰、贾彪等游学洛阳，泰等与同风好。颙显名太学，于是中朝名臣太傅陈蕃、司隶李膺等，皆深接之。及党事起，颙亦名在其中；乃变名姓亡匿汝南间，所至皆交结其豪杰。颙既奇太祖而知荀彧；袁绍慕之，与为奔走之友。是时，天下士大夫多遇党难。颙常岁再三私入洛阳，从绍计议，为诸穷窘之士解释患祸。而袁术亦豪侠，与绍争名。颙未常造术，术深恨之。”《汉末名士录》曰：“术常于众坐数颙三罪，曰：‘王德弥，先觉俊老，名德高亮，而伯求疏之。是一罪也。许子远，凶淫之人，性行不纯，而伯求亲之。是二罪也。郭、贾寒窭，无他资业，而伯求肥马轻裘，光耀道路。是三罪也。’陶丘洪曰：‘王德弥，大贤而短于济时；许子远，虽不纯而赴难不惮濡足。伯求举善则以德弥为首，济难则以子远为宗。且伯求尝为虞伟高手刃复仇，义名奋发。其怨家积财巨万，文马百驷；而欲使伯求羸牛疲马，顿伏道路。此为披其胸而假仇敌之刃也。’术意犹不平。后与南阳宗承，会于阙下，术发怒曰：‘何伯求，凶德也。吾当杀之！’承曰：‘何生，英俊之士。足下善遇之，使延令名于天下。’术乃止。后党禁除解，辟司空府。每三府掾属会议，颙策谋有余，议者皆自以为不及。迁北军中候。董卓以为长史。后荀彧为尚书令，遣人迎叔父司空爽丧；使并置颙尸，而葬之于爽冢傍。”","attribution":"张璠《汉纪》《汉末名士录》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":205,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7f630716ca49b94707fb","start":0,"end":547,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-1039a35e7f4d1f4fe066","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-429397320d5327062c86","layer":"original","quote":"时王芬与豪杰谋废灵帝。语在《武纪》。﹝二﹞芬阴呼歆、洪共定计","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":148,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":86,"end":116,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-f982593720ca5c9cade0","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-429397320d5327062c86","layer":"original","quote":"洪欲行，歆止之曰：“夫废立大事，伊、霍之所难〖5〗。芬性疏而不武〖6〗，此必无成，而祸将及族。子其无往！”洪从歆言而止。后芬果败，洪乃服。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":148,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":117,"end":186,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
